OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells, the best
OL,7,Fof these across the southwest in the
OL,8,Fmorning. A few showers developing,
OL,9,Fsome heavy in the afternoon over
OL,10,FDumfries and Galloway.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers soon dying out,
OL,13,Fotherwise a dry evening with sunny
OL,14,Fspells. Skies becoming mostly clear
OL,15,Fovernight and turning chilly,
OL,16,Fespecially in the glens.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FA chilly start then a dry
OL,19,Fand bright day with sunny spells.
OL,20,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
